    selfhosted_unit_decl_same_name_overwrites_2026-11-26, 0, "Doc: self-hosted unit_decl pool is now keyed by (declaring_module, name) via unit_decl_modules / unit_decl_find_in_module / unit_decl_find_by_suffix_in_module while preserving unqualified fallback; same-module conflicts emit parser_error and cross-module unit X declarations stay isolated. Interpreter specs pass; self-hosted full-CLI verification pending."

