bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    selfhosted_unit_decl_same_name_overwrites_2026-11-26, 0, "Found by code read on release/1.0.0 12aeda7fb1d while fixing the seed twin (SPL-UNIT-002 bare-name unit lookup). Not reproduced by a run: no self-hosted full-CLI binary is deployed on the finding host. unit_decl_register_origin (types.spl:1114-1124) finds an existing row by name alone via unit_decl_find (types.spl:1089) and rewrites its role, short symbol, underlying type tag, alias target and origin in place."
    selfhosted_unit_decl_same_name_overwrites_2026-11-26, 1, "2026-11-27 w3-1: keyed unit_decl_* by (declaring_module, name) in types.spl (unit_decl_modules, unit_decl_find_in_module, unit_decl_find_by_suffix_in_module, UnitDeclPoolSnapshot, FlatPoolState, flat_type_pools_restore), enum_module_body.spl (_parser_lower_unit_decl_checked), unit_scope.spl, and eval_units.spl. Verified unit_decl_module_isolation_spec.spl 5/5, unit_decl_canonical_spec.spl 10/10, unit_decl_e2e_spec.spl 9/9, unit_scope_per_file_spec.spl 4/4, unit_name_conflict_warning_spec.spl 7/7 (--mode=interpreter); self-hosted CLI verification pending."

